  "description": "Click here and download the Modern Tropical Huge Collection graphic · Window, Mac, Linux · Last updated 2026 · Commercial licence included ✓",
  "fullDescription": "Hello and welcome to my store!\n\nJungle Gold is a huge collection that contains a great number of matching elements for your modern design. Tropicals are still a big trend, and this collection unites various illustrations united African wildlife theme. Rich emerald, burnt umber and desert sand shades are combined with delicate sage green, mint and rust – all in watercolour. Some elements are painted in gold, many are embellished with gold effects – dust, sprinkles and speckles.\nThe set combines illustrations, pre-made compositions, frames, seamless patterns plus BONUS – blank watercolor cards for your lovely creations! And some pre-made cards too.\n\nThe kinds of animals and birds in the set:\nCheetah / leopard x 3\nLion x 2\nBlack jaguar / panther x 4\nElephant x 2\nRhino x 2\nZebra x 2\nGiraffe x 3\nMonkey x 2\nSecretary Bird x 2\nBee eater x 2\nGrey Crowned Crane x 2\n\nBotanicals include leaves of: monstera, palm, fern, baobab, areca and many more.\n\nProduct details:\n\n• 24 illustrations of animals and birds in watercolor (PNG)\n• 24 illustrations of animals and birds with gold (PNG)\n• 25 illustrations of plants and flowers in watercolor (PNG)\n• 31 illustrations of plants and flowers with gold (PNG)\n• 21 abstract tribal decorative elements (PNG)\n• 10 gold geometrical frames (PNG)\n• 10 botanical and abstract frames (PNG)\n• 10 pre-made animal & bird compositions (PNG)\n• 10 pre-made flowers & leaves compositions (PNG)\n• BONUS 6 blank watercolour cards\n• 6 pre-made abstract cards (PNG)\n• 20 seamless patterns (JPEG)\n• 13 unique pattern repeats (PNG)\n• BONUS 4 gold patterns (JPEG) + repeats (PNG)\n• all files are high resolution (300 dpi)\n• Download files will be watermarks free\n\nAll images are coloured and ready to use. Colours on your screen may be slightly different from the actual print.\nIf you would like to change image size of this design, have any questions or special requests, please contact me.",
